REASONING TRACE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  1. DEDUPLICATION: Used a simple bounding box check (+/- 0.00045 degrees) 
     for spatial proximity. This is more efficient than a full Haversine 
     calculation for a high-frequency ingestion endpoint.
     
  2. DECOUPLING: Registered tools in Agent definitions early so that 
     agent reasoning traces will reflect tool-awareness, even while the 
     actual tools are empty stubs.

